{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261122/photo/bkn-20261122220035402-1122_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261122220035\"/><p>歐盟擬徵數碼稅填補預算缺口。</p><p>歐盟正研究向全球大型科技企業徵收數碼稅，以填補長期預算缺口。歐洲議會估計，數碼稅等新稅項每年可帶來320億歐元（約2,753億港元）收入。</p><p>歐洲理事會主席科斯塔上周六（21日）提交2028至2034年預算草案，擬削減2,000億歐元（約1.72萬億港元）開支，同時建議向科技巨企開徵新稅，料惹來美國總統特朗普不滿。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:23:48.354995+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T14:00:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T14:57:26.947493+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T14:17:22.660769+00:00","content_hash":"228746212ceade19b6c92cde9bd51b5fd601160b3e04544bd4f9ecc6e334bfb0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}